lly Voiced</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue is brought to life with fantastic performances for every character major and minor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706510/extras/f3322bd75100c2420a8ccaadc0ec0fde.avif?t=1786643076\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain experience in your adventures, choose from skills which will help you garden, trade, or acquire special abilities, like speaking to frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706510/extras/521fe0b5c7430fc3b8405c38fdbfa842.avif?t=1786643076\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Appearance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706510/extras/4d01b9365018aa7728df0a012a8fadb1.poster.avif?t=1786643076\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706510/extras/4d01b9365018aa7728df0a012a8fadb1.webm?t=1786643076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706510/extras/4d01b9365018aa7728df0a012a8fadb1.mp4?t=1786643076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra Curricular Activities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s lots to do in Glimmerwick outside of classes - explore the island, join a band, go fishing, dive for seashells, or join the Green Sprites on forest expeditions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\